      "name": "POLKA CHEMISE",
      "slug": "ploka_chemise",
      "description": "POLKA CHEMISE WITH SCARF\r\n\r\nA timeless expression of elegance and modern modesty, the POLKA Chemise with Scarf is designed for women who appreciate refined simplicity with a bold touch of character. Crafted from a lightweight, breathable fabric, it offers a fluid silhouette that drapes gracefully on the body while ensuring all-day comfort.\r\n\r\nThe design features subtle polka-inspired detailing that adds texture and depth without overpowering the minimalist aesthetic. Its structured yet relaxed cut makes it suitable for both casual wear and elevated occasions.\r\n\r\nPaired with a matching scarf, this piece completes a harmonious look that embodies sophistication and effortless style. The scarf can be styled freelyΓÇöwrapped, draped, or left flowingΓÇöallowing versatility while maintaining a refined modest look.\r\n\r\nPerfect for everyday elegance or special outings, the POLKA Chemise with Scarf represents a balance between tradition and contemporary fashion.",
